# The prebuilt host binaries of a release: the one list `release/Dockerfile.host-binaries`
# builds from and `release/build.py` injects from. A line is skipped while its crate has no
# tracked `Cargo.toml`, so a crate joins the release by existing, not by an edit elsewhere.
#
#   lib <crate dir>                  a path dependency of the binaries: staged into the build
#                                    context and checked (fmt, clippy, tests), never shipped
#   bin <crate dir> <binary name>    built for x86_64-unknown-linux-musl (static) and shipped
#                                    at <crate dir>/bin/linux-amd64/<binary name>, mode 0755
#
# Every crate is standalone with a committed Cargo.lock and builds with `--locked`.
lib pc_common
lib pc_host
bin installer proxy-control-installer
bin version_agent proxy-control-version-agent
